  "worked_solution": "Isolating the seventh-degree term, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+5)^{7}-1 & \\ge 8 \\\\ (x+5)^{7} & \\ge 9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we take the seventh root of both sides and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[7]{(x+5)^{7}} & \\ge \\sqrt[7]{9} \\\\ x+5 & \\ge \\sqrt[7]{9} \\\\ x & \\ge \\sqrt[7]{9}-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
